<div class="game-highlight remove-icons">Apply 3 (<span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Sacred Bark" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Sacred_Bark" title="Sacred Bark">6</a></span>) <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span> to target enemy.</div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt druid-container-small" id="druid-container-2"><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-row druid-row-Title" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Title druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Weak.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/30px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/45px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/60px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> Weak<div class="infobox-edit-button"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="ModuleEditIcon.png" src="/images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/28px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28" srcset="/images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/42px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e 1.5x, /images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/56px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e 2x" data-file-width="202" data-file-height="202" /></a></div></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-StackType" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-label druid-label-StackType">Stack Type</div><div class="druid-data druid-data-StackType druid-data-nonempty">
Duration</div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Text" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Text druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
Attacks deal 25% less damage for X turns.</div></div></div></div>
<p><span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Weak Potion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:WeakPotion.png" class="image"><img alt="WeakPotion.png" src="/images/thumb/WeakPotion.png/24px-WeakPotion.png?91132a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/WeakPotion.png/36px-WeakPotion.png?91132a 1.5x, /images/thumb/WeakPotion.png/48px-WeakPotion.png?91132a 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Weak Potion</a></span> is a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Potions"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Potions_List?rarity=Common"><span>Common</span></a></span> <a href="/wiki/Potion" class="mw-redirect" title="Potion">Potion</a>.
</p>
