<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Sources">Sources</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Weak_Potion?veaction=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Sources" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Weak_Potion?action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Sources"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<table class="wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="min-width: 500px;">

<tbody><tr>
<th>This potion has standard sources:
</th></tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0 15px 15px 15px;">
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Cards">Cards</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Template:Standard_Potion_Sources?action=edit&amp;section=T-1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Cards"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li>Using the card <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Alchemize" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Alchemize" title="Alchemize"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Alchemize" title="Alchemize">Alchemize</a></span> creates 1 random potion (cannot be <span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Fruit Juice" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:FruitJuice.png" class="image"><img alt="FruitJuice.png" src="/images/thumb/FruitJuice.png/24px-FruitJuice.png?c7e082" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/FruitJuice.png/36px-FruitJuice.png?c7e082 1.5x, /images/thumb/FruitJuice.png/48px-FruitJuice.png?c7e082 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Fruit_Juice" title="Fruit Juice">Fruit Juice</a></span>).</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Events">Events</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Template:Standard_Potion_Sources?action=edit&amp;section=T-2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Events"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li><span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Lab" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Lab" title="Lab"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Lab" title="Lab">Lab</a></span> offers you 3 random potions.</li>
<li><span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="The Woman in Blue" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/The_Woman_in_Blue" title="The Woman in Blue"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a href="/wiki/The_Woman_in_Blue" title="The Woman in Blue">The Woman in Blue</a></span> allows you to buy 1 random potion for 20 gold, 2 for 30 gold, or 3 for 40 gold.</li>
<li><span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Knowing Skull" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Knowing_Skull" title="Knowing Skull"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Knowing_Skull" title="Knowing Skull">Knowing Skull</a></span> grants you a random potion at the cost of 10% of your HP (minimum 6).</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Relics">Relics</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Template:Standard_Potion_Sources?action=edit&amp;section=T-3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Relics"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="White Beast Statue" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/White_Beast_Statue" title="White Beast Statue"><img alt="WhiteBeastStatue.png" src="/images/thumb/WhiteBeastStatue.png/24px-WhiteBeastStatue.png?9da036" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/WhiteBeastStatue.png/36px-WhiteBeastStatue.png?9da036 1.5x, /images/thumb/WhiteBeastStatue.png/48px-WhiteBeastStatue.png?9da036 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/White_Beast_Statue" title="White Beast Statue">White Beast Statue</a></span> ensures potion will always drop after combat.</li>
<li>Obtaining <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Cauldron" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Cauldron" title="Cauldron"><img alt="Cauldron.png" src="/images/thumb/Cauldron.png/24px-Cauldron.png?20897a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Cauldron.png/36px-Cauldron.png?20897a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Cauldron.png/48px-Cauldron.png?20897a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Cauldron" title="Cauldron">Cauldron</a></span> offers you 5 random potions.</li>
<li>Obtaining <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Tiny House" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Tiny_House" title="Tiny House"><img alt="TinyHouse.png" src="/images/thumb/TinyHouse.png/24px-TinyHouse.png?591f4c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/TinyHouse.png/36px-TinyHouse.png?591f4c 1.5x, /images/thumb/TinyHouse.png/48px-TinyHouse.png?591f4c 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Tiny_House" title="Tiny House">Tiny House</a></span> offers you 1 random potion.</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Other">Other</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Template:Standard_Potion_Sources?action=edit&amp;section=T-4" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Other"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li><span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Entropic Brew" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:EntropicBrew.png" class="image"><img alt="EntropicBrew.png" src="/images/thumb/EntropicBrew.png/24px-EntropicBrew.png?7ce109" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EntropicBrew.png/36px-EntropicBrew.png?7ce109 1.5x, /images/thumb/EntropicBrew.png/48px-EntropicBrew.png?7ce109 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Entropic_Brew" title="Entropic Brew">Entropic Brew</a></span> fills all your empty potion slots, including its slot, with random potions (cannot generate <span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Fruit Juice" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:FruitJuice.png" class="image"><img alt="FruitJuice.png" src="/images/thumb/FruitJuice.png/24px-FruitJuice.png?c7e082" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/FruitJuice.png/36px-FruitJuice.png?c7e082 1.5x, /images/thumb/FruitJuice.png/48px-FruitJuice.png?c7e082 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Fruit_Juice" title="Fruit Juice">Fruit Juice</a></span> while in combat).</li>
<li>Potions can be bought at the <a href="/wiki/Merchant" class="mw-redirect" title="Merchant">Merchant</a>.</li>
<li>If you reached the <a href="/wiki/Boss" class="mw-redirect" title="Boss">Boss</a> of the first Act in the previous run, <a href="/wiki/Neow" title="Neow">Neow</a> may offer you 3 potions as the <a href="/wiki/Neow#Second_Blessing" title="Neow">Second Blessing</a>.</li></ul>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Interactions">Interactions</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Weak_Potion?veaction=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Interactions" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Weak_Potion?action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Interactions"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Synergies">Synergies</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Weak_Potion?veaction=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Synergies" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Weak_Potion?action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Synergies"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
